{"id":"T01","category":"feature","track":"concurrency","baseline":"6352f6d^","gold_commit":"6352f6d","suite":"mgi_m16","gold_assertions":15,"task":"用户报告：在多个界面操作同时写数据库时，偶发“database is locked”导致写入失败，而且失败后数据只写进去一半，需要手工修复。请实现一个单写者写入队列：所有写操作排队后串行执行，支持优先级、支持取消排队中的任务、事务失败要整体回滚并把错误传给调用方、程序退出时队列要能排空。","allowed_paths":["include/database/WriteQueue.h","src/database/WriteQueue.cpp","CMakeLists.txt"],"forbidden_paths":["tests/"],"verify":"ctest --test-dir build -R '^mgi_m16$' --output-on-failure","source":"git commit 6352f6d","difficulty":"medium"}
{"id":"T02","category":"feature","track":"data-quality","baseline":"97d8ce2^","gold_commit":"97d8ce2","suite":"mgi_m19","gold_assertions":21,"task":"用户报告：库用久了会出现三类问题但系统发现不了——①同一个作品被导入了多次（重复实体）②关系表里指向了已经不存在的实体（孤儿关系）③同一个字段有多个来源给了不同值（冲突）。现在没有任何报表能看见这些，只能人工翻。请实现一份数据质量报告，能分别列出重复、孤儿、冲突三类问题，并对重复实体给出合并建议。","allowed_paths":["include/match/DataQuality.h","src/match/DataQuality.cpp","include/database/IndexDatabase.h","src/database/IndexDatabase.cpp","CMakeLists.txt"],"forbidden_paths":["tests/"],"verify":"ctest --test-dir build -R '^mgi_m19$' --output-on-failure","source":"git commit 97d8ce2","difficulty":"medium"}
